      "source": [
        "# **SecuAgentNet+**\n",
        "### **AI Multi-Agent Platform for Threat Detection, Fraud Prevention & Digital Safety**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Author:** Md Abdul Subhan  \n",
        "**Track:** Kaggle Agents Intensive Capstone 2025 — Freestyle\n",
        "\n",
        "![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)  \n",
        "![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-Proof_of_Concept-green.svg)  \n",
        "![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.11%2B-informational.svg)\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## **Abstract (TL;DR)**\n",
        "SecuAgentNet+ is an audit-first hybrid multi-agent system for detecting phishing, scams, forged documents, and deepfakes. It combines:\n",
        "- Rule-based heuristics\n",
        "- LLM-based reasoning\n",
        "- Governance & autonomy scoring (AURA)\n",
        "- Full audit logging for each incident\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook documents dataset design, pipeline, evaluation results, and visualizations prepared for the Kaggle Capstone submission.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## **Table of Contents**\n",
        "1. [Project Overview](#project-overview)\n",
        "2. [Dataset](#dataset)\n",
        "3. [How to Run (Quick)](#how-to-run-quick)\n",
        "4. [Pipeline & Agents](#pipeline-agents)\n",
        "5. [Evaluation & Metrics](#evaluation-metrics)\n",
        "6. [Visualizations](#visualizations)\n",
        "7. [Audit Logs & Reports](#audit-logs-reports)\n",
        "8. [Limitations & Future Work](#limitations-future)\n",
        "9. [Contact](#contact)\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "overview-0002",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## <a id=\"project-overview\"></a> **Project Overview**\n",
        "SecuAgentNet+ demonstrates an enterprise-grade approach to incident triage (emails, messages, uploads, media). The design prioritizes **high recall**, **explainability**, and **traceable audit logs**.\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Key Features**\n",
        "- Hybrid detection (Rule Engine + LLM Agent)\n",
        "- Structured JSON outputs\n",
        "- Governance engine with autonomy scoring\n",
        "- Modular agents: Detection, Misuse, Deepfake, Cross-check, Reporting\n",
        "- Full per-incident audit logs\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "dataset-0003",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## <a id=\"dataset\"></a> **Dataset**\n",
        "- `data/synthetic_incidents_professional.csv` — 2,000 synthetic incidents\n",
        "- Columns: `incident_id, content, sender, attachment_types, links, label, metadata...`\n",
        "\n",
        "> All data is synthetic, ensuring privacy and allowing safe experimentation.\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "runquick-0004",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# <a id=\"how-to-run-quick\"></a> **How to Run (Quick)**\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Recommended Python Version**\n",
        "Use **Python 3.11.x** (preferably **3.11.9**).\n",
        "\n",
        "## **1. Create Virtual Environment & Install Dependencies**\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "python3.11 -m venv .venv\n",
        "\n",
        "# Windows PowerShell\n",
        ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n",
        "\n",
        "# Unix/macOS\n",
        "source .venv/bin/activate\n",
        "\n",
        "# Install packages\n",
        "pip install -r requirements.txt\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "## **2. Example Commands**\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "# Run full pipeline\N",
        "python -m scripts.run_pipeline_full\n",
        "\n",
        "# Prompt tuning test\n",
        "python -m scripts.prompt_tuning_test --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini\n",
        "\n",
        "# Evaluate metrics\n",
        "python -m scripts.evaluate\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Security Note**\n",
        "- Never commit `.env` files or API keys.\n",
        "- Always use `./env.example` as reference.\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "pipeline-0005",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# <a id=\"pipeline-agents\"></a> **Pipeline & Agents**\n",
        "\n",
        "### **High-Level Workflow**\n",
        "- Preprocessing (clean, extract URLs, attachments)\n",
        "- Rule Engine → *rule_score*\n",
        "- LLM Agent → structured JSON (classification, IOCs, confidence)\n",
        "- **Fusion Logic:** `final_score = 0.4 * rule_score + 0.6 * llm_confidence`\n",
        "- Governance (AURA autonomy scoring)\n",
        "- Reporting (audit logs + metrics)\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Agent Components**\n",
        "- `src/agents/detection_agent.py`\n",
        "- `src/agents/detection_agent_llm.py`\n",
        "- `src/agents/misuse_agent.py`\n",
        "- `src/agents/deepfake_agent.py`\n",
        "- `src/agents/governance_agent.py`\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "metrics-0006",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# <a id=\"evaluation-metrics\"></a> **Evaluation & Metrics**\n",
        "### **Sample Results (Experimental)**\n",
        "- Precision: **0.4203**\n",
        "- Recall: **0.7843**\n",
        "- F1 Score: **0.5473**\n",
        "- ROC AUC: **0.7342**\n",
        "- Decision Threshold: **0.6**\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Reports Saved At**\n",
        "- `reports/metrics.json`\n",
        "- `reports/`\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ]
