        "# <a id=\"audit-logs-reports\"></a> **Audit Logs & Reports**\n",
        "Each processed incident produces a JSON audit file stored in:\n",
        "- `logs/`\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Each Audit Log Contains:**\n",
        "- `incident_id`, timestamps\n",
        "- Rule score, LLM output, final score\n",
        "- Governance reasoning\n",
        "- Evidence chain\n",
        "\n",
        "These logs guarantee **traceability** and **reproducibility**.\n",
        "\n",
